  "score": 8.0,
  "problems": [
   "The rock base is a bit busy with tiny shells, sponges and little yellow/red fronds. It is more detailed and painterly than the house's clean-shaded look, though it still reads fine at film size.",
   "In the 'in a place' panel the coral top reaches about the person's chest to shoulder and the rock footprint looks a little wide. That is within spec but at the upper end."
  ]
 }
